# KitLayer - put it ONCE in the app shell: it loads the kit core so the library's shared pieces work everywhere
# (the tooltip on anything with a name, the Island, the icon sprite, the floating layer that follows the skin).
#   shell { Stack { Custom KitLayer class("cx-kit-host")  … slot … } }   (a shell cannot call plugin parts: use the Custom directly)
# shadcn-for-muten · Custom (kit core) · host JS is kit-layer.js.
part KitLayer() { Custom KitLayer class("cx-kit-host") }
